  "answer": "I found no past ticket that reports this exact problem. Shortcut Guide was redesigned in v0.100. The new version opens as a full-screen themed window, and you press the shortcut once instead of holding it. The closest tickets are #48441 and #48556, but they report crashes and a window that flashes and closes. They don't report the opaque full-screen background. Please treat your report as a request for a transparent or overlay-style Shortcut Guide. Keep the bug report ZIP attached so the team can review it. Also check that you're on the latest PowerToys release."
 },
